{"v":4,"catch":"在這個來自Nikoli的雙重挑戰的原創謎題中，\n畫出一個循環，並將單元格塗成黑色。","desc":"在這個原創的Nikoli謎題中，通過單元格的中心畫線來形成一個循環，並將單元格塗成黑色。看到線條和黑色單元格如何組合成一個解決方案是非常令人滿意的，而弄清楚如何畫出循環並不像看起來那麼容易。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文本都有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-06-01","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d34b3191a715f05cb9fe96f4200204d68cc40b9e3bc377664713af8dd3e15c77.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9348a7cf0ec7f11e9058b340a4512038b71c77ba95267a27efb6aa90c6c268c7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f989b6468f76e179d201dafbc199f962ffc2f67a588ba7462188e49485683adc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b7bc27095e0daa57443ded5a09034b5b7332ac53f23c89bc869211b55b00bf1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6029f32152f977c9dd4b2574f6c3ee6c76f67a86250ed08916629eba1fb01eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5965db228ca0c43742adb1d1ac7090c8e4f91910a2f72d7d66822f1e29f7e708.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ec500e992000","dlc":[]}